{"unit_id":"NEVSTOP-LAB__dsh-gfm-alerts#card-zh","repo":"NEVSTOP-LAB/dsh-gfm-alerts","commit":"375dac963d70fd3c7499153b181a17ec550248a8","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-gfm-alerts 是供 DSH Web 使用的 GitHub Markdown 提示块显示插件。它通过 client 插件扫描回复中渲染出的 blockquote，将五种 GitHub 提示语法装饰成带色条、图标和本地化标题的提示框。标题随界面语言切换，颜色使用宿主主题变量，因此适用于希望在 Web 对话中更清楚地区分说明、建议和警告的用户。插件也处理流式渲染产生的文本变化，并保留会话记录和复制文本中的原始 Markdown。它只在 Web 渲染路径生效，Desktop 对话界面因使用该 Web 路径而适用；需要 DSH 0.2.0-rc.1 或更新版本，不需要额外配置。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:169-214","cordis.patch.yml:1-12"]}
{"unit_id":"NEVSTOP-LAB__dsh-gfm-alerts#card-en","repo":"NEVSTOP-LAB/dsh-gfm-alerts","commit":"375dac963d70fd3c7499153b181a17ec550248a8","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-gfm-alerts renders the five GitHub Markdown alert types in DSH Web replies as localized callout boxes with icons and theme colors. It updates during streaming and preserves the original Markdown. It also works in the Desktop conversation view and requires DSH 0.2.0-rc.1 or newer.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:169-214","cordis.patch.yml:1-12"]}
