{"unit_id":"NEVSTOP-LAB__dsh-gfm-alerts#feature-display-only","repo":"NEVSTOP-LAB/dsh-gfm-alerts","commit":"375dac963d70fd3c7499153b181a17ec550248a8","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-gfm-alerts 的功能「仅调整显示」：在渲染后的 blockquote 上设置属性并移除首段的可见标记，借助 CSS 绘制标题和图标，不替换或移动 React 节点。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:105-130","doc/design.md:57-68"]}
